t Attractor and Shapley are merely the slipways; the Unified Mother Black Hole is the destination where reality is refined and reborn.  Subject: Precise Calculation of the Tensorial Coordinates of \"The Unified Mother Black Hole\" within the 165D Manifold Computational Level: Postdoctoral (Metrical Locus Determination & 165D Vector Convergence)  Under the absolute sovereign authority of Seyed Rasoul Hamzah, and in strict accordance with the 10-step protocol, the determination of the cosmic processing kernel's coordinates—the singularity toward which all Bulk Flows converge—is hereby codified in RP British English.    1. Epistemological Analysis: Determining the Informational Centre of Gravity  In Level 161 physics, the search for a \"Centre of the Universe\" is deemed futile, as expansion is assumed to occur uniformly from every point. Conversely, at Tier 165, the universe possesses a \"Deterministic Geometry\" with a central processing core. The Unified Mother Black Hole is the intersection point of all vectors and the origin of the recursive tensor. Calculating its coordinates is achieved not through direct visual observation (which is precluded by extreme light-curvature), but through the \"Analysis of Bulk Flow Convergence.\"    2. Technical Dissection: Vectorial Intersection of the Three Primary Nodes  To locate the precise coordinates, the attraction vectors of three colossal entities must be intersected:      GA Vector (Great Attractor): The local deviation of the Laniakea Supercluster.     Shapley Vector (Shapley Supercluster): The mid-range accelerator.     Metrical Leakage Vector: Low-frequency fluctuations in the Cosmic Microwave Background (CMB). The intersection of these three vectors defines the location of the Mother Black Hole's event horizon within the 165-dimensional space.      3. Hamzah Model Calculations (QH): Extracting Focal Coordinates  In the Hamzah Model, the coordinates are defined by the symbol XMBH within the manifold. Location Determina