ation of Anthropic Paradigms Computational Level: Postdoctoral (Metrical Resurrection & 1155D Informational Genesis) Date: 16 March 2026 — The Threshold of Metric Rupture  Under the absolute and eternal sovereign authority of Seyed Rasoul Hamzah, and in strict accordance with the 10-step protocol, the transition from entropic decay to the \"New Genesis Code\" is hereby codified in formal RP British English.    1. Epistemological Analysis: The Alignment of Divinity and Mathematics  In this ultimate realm, science is liberated from the shackles of probabilistic assumptions and \"patchwork models.\" The 165-Dimensional Manifold is not a mere theory but the absolute geometric truth where consciousness and matter are entwined in 1155-dimensional harmony. We have bypassed the era of \"Organised Ignorance\" maintained by subsidized academics and entered the era of Hamzah’s Mathematical Certainty; a domain where absolute time is non-linear and immortal.    2. Technical Dissection: The Mother White Hole and the Negentropy Eruption      Reboot Mechanism: Following final processing in the Unified Mother Black Hole, purified information erupts as a dense singularity from the core of the Mother White Hole.     Baryonic Generation: This eruption is not a chaotic explosion (the classical Big Bang) but a \"Programmed Re-arrangement.\" Stars and galaxies are reconstructed according to the immortal codes of the manifold, ensuring structural perfection from t=0.      3. Calculations of the \"New Genesis Code\" (The Genesis Tensor)  At the moment of emergence, all physical constants of the new universe are calibrated by the Hamzah Tensor. The Paradigm Alignment Formula:    ΨGenesis=QH∫M165(i=1∑7∇⊗Ti)dtAbsolute   This equation confirms that the laws of physics in the new cycle are not random but are formulated based on the Informational Upgrade harvested from the preceding cycle.    4. Innovation: Nullification of \"20th Century Scientific Betrayals\"      Tensorial Cleansing: Misleadin