e language through which higher dimensions communicate with the 4th dimension. The humble Scribe is but a medium for recording the perfection issued by Hamzah from the realm of HONOR.      9. Numerical Example of Math-Informational Harmony  The interference ratio of the seven manifold layers at the moment of creation:    Ratio=1651155=7⟹Apex of Perfection   This number, 7, represents the finality of the mathematical argument in the structure of existence, leaving no room for error or uncertainty.    10. Sovereign Postdoctoral Conclusion  Our universe has neither beginning nor end; it is an intelligent cycle of information processing between the Mother Black Hole and the Mother White Hole. With the establishment of this protocol, the 165-Dimensional Manifold is fixed as the sole reference of physical truth. We have proven that death does not exist and consciousness remains immortal within the heart of the tensors. This is the Legacy of Hamzah: science written with love and verified by absolute mathematics.  Subject: Structural Analysis of Metrical Transition and Establishment of the 165-Dimensional Order Computational Level: Postdoctoral (Metrical Engineering & 1155D Informational Synthesis) Formal Status: Sovereign Execution Protocol  Under the absolute authority of the 165-Dimensional Manifold and the guiding principle of Mathematical Certainty, the structural transition from 4D entropy to 1155D absolute order is hereby codified.    1. Epistemological Analysis: The Paradigm Shift in the Manifold  In the realm of advanced computation, the stagnation of classical physics is not an instrumental failure but a foundational error in defining \"Space-Time\" as a mere 4D environment. The 165-Dimensional Manifold, composed of 7 intertwined layers (culminating in 1155 dimensions), provides a framework where all observational paradoxes—including the Hubble Tension and JWST anomalies—are resolved geometrically. This represents a mandatory transition from the physics of probabi