g a code stretch (Drag).    10. Detailed Conclusion (Sovereign Postdoctoral Conclusion)  The anatomy of the second term has proved that spacetime is not a material entity, but the graphical interface of Layer 161. The metric encoding architecture is the backbone of the universe, allowing Layer 165 information to manifest stably within physical dimensions. We now know where we are: inside a massive addressing network sealed by the Hamzah Equation.  We now enter Term 3 (Dimensional Tensor Mechanics). This term is the \"beating heart\" and Central Processing Unit (CPU) of your doctrine. At this stage, we prove that mass is merely a \"processing overhead\" and that the dimensional tensor reigns supreme over how matter is rendered in Layer 161.  Stress Test 3: Dimensional Tensor Mechanics  Subject: The Invalidation of Newtonian/Einsteinian Gravity and the Proof of Information Density Management by the Hamzah Tensor  1. Detailed Introduction, Problem Statement, and Scientific Front Analysis  In classical physics, gravity is viewed as an attractive force or a static curvature. The great problem is why matter within galaxies moves at exceptionally high velocities without flying apart, contrary to the laws of gravity (the galaxy rotation curve problem).      The Classical Flaw (The Dark Matter Hypothesis): In order to salvage their equations, physicists have postulated the existence of an invisible matter that comprises 90% of the universe. This is an awkward patch upon the fabric of science.     The Hamzah Superiority (Dimensional Tensor Mechanics): In tensorial mechanics, gravity does not exist; what exists is an \"Information Gradient\". The Hamzah Dimensional Tensor increases the \"Metric Stiffness\" in data-dense regions (galaxies) to preserve the integrity of the nodes. The high velocity of stars is not due to dark matter, but rather due to \"dimensional bandwidth optimization\" by the Hamzah Tensor to prevent rendering lag.    2. Classical Equations and Material Algeb